{"id":"n2-005","title":"A。したがって B。(A. Shitagatte B.)","jlptLevel":2,"shortExplanation":"Express a cause-and-effect relationship; 'therefore', 'consequently', 'so'.","longExplanation":"The したがって grammar point is used to express a cause-and-effect relationship between two sentences, where 'A' is the cause and 'B' is the effect, result or conclusion. It can be translated as 'therefore', 'consequently', or 'so' in English.","formation":"A + したがって + B","examples":[{"jp":"今日は雨が降っています。したがって、傘を持って行きましょう。","romaji":"Kyou wa ame ga futteimasu. Shitagatte, kasa wo motte ikimashou.","en":"It is raining today. Therefore, let's bring an umbrella.","words":[{"surface":"今日","vocabId":"1579110","reading":"きょう"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"雨","vocabId":"1171900","reading":"あめ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"降っ","vocabId":"1282790","reading":"ふる","baseForm":"降る"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null},{"surface":"したがって","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"傘","vocabId":"1301940","reading":"かさ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"持っ","vocabId":"1315720","reading":"もつ","baseForm":"持つ"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行き","vocabId":"1578790","reading":"いき","baseForm":"行く"},{"surface":"ましょ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[9]},{"jp":"彼は忙しいです。したがって、彼に連絡するのはやめましょう。","romaji":"Kare wa isogashii desu. Shitagatte, kare ni renraku suru no wa yamemashou.","en":"He is busy. Consequently, let's not contact him.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"忙しい","vocabId":"1519290","reading":"いそがしい"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null},{"surface":"したがって","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"連絡","vocabId":"1559900","reading":"れんらく"},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":"1537250","reading":"の"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"やめ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"やめる"},{"surface":"ましょ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5]},{"jp":"そのレストランは人気があります。したがって、予約しないと席がないかもしれません。","romaji":"Sono resutoran wa ninki ga arimasu. Shitagatte, yoyaku shinai to seki ga nai kamoshiremasen.","en":"That restaurant is popular. Therefore, there might be no seats if you don't make a reservation.","words":[{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"レストラン","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"人気","vocabId":"1367010","reading":"にんき"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"あり","vocabId":"1225940","reading":"あり","baseForm":"ある"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null},{"surface":"したがって","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"予約","vocabId":"1543750","reading":"よやく"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"席","vocabId":"1382250","reading":"せき"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":"2098290","reading":"ない"},{"surface":"かも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"しれ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"しれる"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[8]},{"jp":"試験が近いです。したがって、勉強に集中しましょう。","romaji":"Shiken ga chikai desu. Shitagatte, benkyou ni shuuchuu shimashou.","en":"The exam is coming up soon. Consequently, let's focus on studying.","words":[{"surface":"試験","vocabId":"1312350","reading":"しけん"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"近い","vocabId":"1242130","reading":"ちかい"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null},{"surface":"したがって","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"勉強","vocabId":"1512670","reading":"べんきょう"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"集中","vocabId":"1333750","reading":"しゅうちゅう"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"ましょ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5]}],"formalityLevel":"very-formal-literary","usageNote":"Formal, literary \"therefore/consequently\" - written, academic, or formal speech.","family":{"id":"therefore","name":"Therefore (Formal Cause-Result)","relatedPoints":["n2-009"]}}